          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.2px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.35; text-align:left; outline:none;\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P1</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Front Page: Free Desktop Print</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P2</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Tech: Master Pages & Vault Safety</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P3</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Markets: Subscription Costs Hit $0</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P4</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Opinion & Reader Letters Desk</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P5</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Arts: WordArt, Themes & Dark Mode</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P6</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Community: Calendar & Fun Tab</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P7</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Classifieds: Tips, Shortcuts & QR</span></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0; padding-bottom:7px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1; line-height:1.35;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-right:5px;\">P8</span><span style=\"color:#1f2937;\">Back Page: Print Guide & Puzzle</span></div></div>",
