          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.4px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.45; text-align:left; outline:none;\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:2px;\">1. Zero Telemetry or Lock-In</div><div>No user sign-in, watermarks, or cloud account required. Keep drafts on USB sticks, NAS drives, or email attachments.</div></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:2px;\">2. Legacy File Rescue Built In</div><div>Open existing Microsoft <b>.pub</b> publications alongside <b>.docx</b> reports and <b>.pdf</b> handouts straight inside your workspace.</div></div><div style=\"margin:0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:2px;\">3. Built for Every Desk</div><div>Ships for Windows, macOS, Linux (Flatpak, AppImage, DEB, RPM), FreeBSD, Web browsers, and 32-bit Windows XP hardware.</div></div></div>",
