        {
          "id": "pub-el-gaz-0055",
          "left": "544px",
          "top": "480px",
          "width": "202px",
          "height": "548px",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": "10",
          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.3px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.44; text-align:left; outline:none;\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:3px;\">Previous Versions (.BAK)</div><div>Before major edits overwrite your front-page headline, OpenPublisher's Backup Manager preserves local revision snapshots so editors can inspect and restore prior drafts in seconds.</div></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:3px;\">AES-GCM Encryption</div><div>Preparing confidential board budgets, school exam booklets, or legal filings? Password-protect any <b>.opub</b> document with built-in Web Crypto <b>AES-GCM</b> encryption before sharing.</div></div><div style=\"margin:0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-bottom:3px;\">Zero Cloud Exposure</div><div>Encryption keys and recovery snapshots never touch remote servers, satisfying strict school and non-profit privacy rules.</div></div></div>",
