          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.5px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.42; text-align:justify; outline:none;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:0.8px; margin-bottom:4px;\">ANNUAL TREASURY BRIEFING</div><div style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">For volunteer boards operating on bake sales and member dues, recurring software seats quietly consume funds needed for paper stock, postage, and ink cartridges.</div><div style=\"margin:0;\">Because OpenPublisher runs royalty-free across unlimited volunteer laptops, treasurers allocate 100% of publishing capital straight to physical community outreach.</div></div>",
