          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:8.8px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.38; text-align:left; outline:none;\"><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:#111827; margin-bottom:2px;\">THE OPEN GAZETTE</div><div style=\"font-size:8.5px; font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; letter-spacing:0.7px; padding-bottom:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1; margin-bottom:10px;\">EDITORIAL BOARD</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:9px;\"><b>Managing Editor</b><br>Arthur Pendleton</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:9px;\"><b>Layout Architect</b><br>Clara Bennett</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:9px;\"><b>Systems &amp; Print Desk</b><br>Miriam Patel &amp; David Kim</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\"><b>Reader Mail Desk</b><br>Rosa Delgado</div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-top:9px; margin-bottom:9px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#991b1b; margin-bottom:3px;\">Open-Source Charter</div><div>Published under GNU GPL v2 freedoms. View, audit, compile, or share freely with every neighbor.</div></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-top:9px; margin-bottom:9px;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#111827; margin-bottom:3px;\">Pressroom Typography</div><div>Headlines set in Playfair Display; broadsheet body copy in Merriweather at 96 DPI master precision.</div></div><div style=\"font-style:italic; color:#4b5563;\">Printed without tracking cookies, paywalls, or remote ad brokers.</div></div>",
