          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size:14.5px; color:#0f5c57; line-height:1.34; text-align:center; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; outline:none;\">\"A town newsletter crafted in 2016 should still open effortlessly in 2036, without asking any volunteer to renew a subscription first.\"</div>",
