        {
          "id": "pub-el-gaz-0094",
          "left": "532px",
          "top": "146px",
          "width": "226px",
          "height": "622px",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": "10",
          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.2px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.42; text-align:left; outline:none;\"><div style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:3px;\">Twelve Years Rescued</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">I dreaded migrating 140 monthly church bulletins out of MS Publisher before October. OpenPublisher imported our .pub files straight off my flash drive in one Saturday afternoon.</div><div style=\"font-style:italic; color:#4b5563; font-size:8.5px;\">Margaret Holloway, St. Jude Parish, Oregon</div></div><div style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px dotted #cbd5e1;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:3px;\">Classroom Broadcast Magic</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Using the built-in Classroom Broadcast view on our Wi-Fi LAN lets thirty middle-school students read my live annotated worksheet on classroom iPads with zero logins.</div><div style=\"font-style:italic; color:#4b5563; font-size:8.5px;\">Elena Alvarez, Civic Magnet School</div></div><div style=\"margin:0;\"><div style=\"font-weight:700; color:#0f5c57; margin-bottom:3px;\">Smooth Sailing on Linux</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Most DTP apps treat Linux like an afterthought. The native Flatpak package prints dual-page spreads cleanly to my workshop laser printer every time.</div><div style=\"font-style:italic; color:#4b5563; font-size:8.5px;\">Devon Knightley, Linux Mint User, Bristol</div></div></div>",
          "imgSrc": "",
          "clipPath": "",
          "bg": "",
          "cropMode": false,
          "imgStyle": {},
