          "zIndex": "10",
          "overflow": "visible",
          "type": "text",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:100%; height:100%; padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:'Merriweather', Georgia, serif; font-size:9.5px; color:#1f2937; line-height:1.44; text-align:justify; outline:none;\"><div style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:#111827; margin:0 0 6px 0;\">Interactive Learning in Minutes</div><div style=\"margin:0 0 9px 0;\">When Friday reading clubs or science fairs need custom crosswords, secret cipher worksheets, or connect-the-dots activities, educators open OpenPublisher's built-in <b>Fun Ribbon tab</b> directly beside their layout.</div><div style=\"margin:0;\">Every studio outputs crisp editable vector frames plus an automatic Page 2 Answer Key, and pairs seamlessly with Classroom Broadcast over local Wi-Fi for tablet previews.</div></div>",
